# .mailmap: one canonical name and address per person, for `git shortlog`, `git log` and GitHub.
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
# See https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap. This changes how names are shown; it does not rewrite history.
# The canonical address is the person's GitHub noreply address, matching tameru-compaction-system.

